caption: Recover Energy
tradition-component: recover-energy

Recover Energy is a Yang-Wood-Dragon effect. Anyone with any skill in all three Words is treated as knowing the standard GURPS Recover Energy spell at a skill equal to the lowest of Yang, Wood, and Dragon. Use the normal Recover Energy rules.
